  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Paul Christiano stated that if superintelligence is built without more robust alignment, he expects humanity will permanently lose control of it. He also described a possible 10 to 20% chance of AI takeover with many or most humans dead. He said the most likely way we die is not that AI comes out of the blue and kills us. He discussed having a lot of AI control over critical systems, even in running a military.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s3",
    "s4"
   ],
